#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.expanding.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.expanding"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.expanding:1 of
msgid "Provide expanding window calculations."
msgstr "提供扩展窗口计算。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.expanding:3 of
msgid ""
"Returns a :class:`LiteFrameExpanding` object whose aggregation methods "
"(``.sum()``, ``.mean()``, ...) compute a growing cumulative window from "
"the start to the current row. Unlike ``cum*``, expanding fills NaN "
"positions with the accumulated value."
msgstr ""
"返回一个 :class:`LiteFrameExpanding` 对象，其聚合方法（``.sum()``、``."
"mean()`` 等）从开始到当前行计算增长的累积窗口。与 ``cum*`` 不同，扩展会用"
"累积值填充 NaN 位置。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.expanding.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.expanding:8 of
msgid ""
"Minimum number of observations in the window required to produce a value "
"(otherwise null)."
msgstr "窗口中产生值所需的最小观测数（否则为null）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.expanding:11 of
msgid ""
"Column(s) to aggregate. If None, all columns are aggregated. Non-selected"
" columns are passed through unchanged."
msgstr "要聚合的列。如果为None，则聚合所有列。未选择的列保持不变。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.expanding:14 of
msgid ""
"Column(s) that define the order in which the window expands (equivalent "
"to ``ORDER BY`` inside a MaxCompute ``OVER()`` clause). The output row "
"order is unchanged; each row receives the aggregation computed over the "
"rows that precede it in *order_by* order."
msgstr ""
"定义窗口扩展顺序的列（相当于 MaxCompute ``OVER()`` 子句中的 ``ORDER BY``"
"）。输出行顺序保持不变；每行接收在 *order_by* 顺序中位于其前面的行的聚合"
"结果。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.expanding:19 of
msgid ""
"Sort direction for each *order_by* column. A single bool is broadcast to "
"all columns."
msgstr "*order_by* 列的排序方向。单个布尔值会广播到所有列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.expanding:22 of
msgid ""
"Offset the leading edge of the growing window by N rows. A positive value"
" extends the window forward (the window becomes ``[0, i+shift]``), a "
"negative value shrinks it. Matches the MaxCompute ``shift`` MF-specific "
"window parameter."
msgstr ""
"将增长窗口的前缘偏移N行。正值将窗口向前扩展（窗口变为 ``[0, i+shift]``）"
"，负值会缩小它。匹配 MaxCompute ``shift`` MF特定窗口参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.expanding:27 of
msgid ""
"Flip the expanding window so it grows from the last row backward (a "
"\"narrowing\" window covering ``[i, n-1]``). Matches the MaxCompute "
"``reverse_range`` MF-specific window parameter. May be combined with "
"``window_shift``: the window then covers ``[i+window_shift, n-1]``."
msgstr ""
"翻转扩展窗口，使其从最后一行向后增长（覆盖 ``[i, n-1]`` 的\"收窄\"窗口）"
"。匹配 MaxCompute ``reverse_range`` MF特定窗口参数。可以与 ``window_shift"
"`` 结合使用：窗口然后覆盖 ``[i+window_shift, n-1]``。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.expanding.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.expanding:33 of
msgid "Intermediate object; call an aggregation method to produce a LiteFrame."
msgstr "中间对象；调用聚合方法以生成LiteFrame。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.expanding.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.expanding:38 of
msgid ":py:obj:`rolling`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.expanding:39 of
msgid "Provide rolling-window calculations."
msgstr "提供滚动窗口计算。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.expanding:41 of
msgid ":py:obj:`shift`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.expanding:42 of
msgid "Shift rows by a given number of periods."
msgstr "按给定的周期数移动行。"

